                          ]
                        },
                        "accordion_row_UeK3zd": {
                          "type": "_accordion-row",
                          "settings": {
                            "heading": "Do I need a Booster to charge the thermometer?",
                            "open_by_default": false,
                            "icon": "none",
                            "width": 20
                          },
                          "blocks": {
                            "text_XkmReU": {
                              "type": "text",
                              "settings": {
                                "text": "<p>No. Display and Giant Grill Gauge kits without a Booster include a charging cradle. A Booster adds cordless recharging. Use your own USB-C cable and standard 5V USB power source; neither is included.</p>",
                                "width": "fit-content",
                                "max_width": "none",
                                "alignment": "left",
                                "type_preset": "custom",
                                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                                "font_size": "1rem",
                                "line_height": "normal",
                                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                                "case": "none",
                                "wrap": "pretty",
                                "text_color": "",
                                "background": false,
                                "background_color": "#00000026",
                                "corner_radius": 0,
                                "padding-block-start": 0,
                                "padding-block-end": 0,
                                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                                "padding-inline-end": 0
                              },
                              "blocks": {}
                            }
                          },
                          "block_order": [
                            "text_XkmReU"
                          ]
                        },
                        "accordion_row_6LndYN": {
                          "type": "_accordion-row",
                          "settings": {
                            "heading": "How does my Predictive Thermometer connect wirelessly?",
                            "open_by_default": false,
                            "icon": "none",
                            "width": 20
                          },
                          "blocks": {
                            "text_YEyRtq": {
                              "type": "text",
                              "settings": {
                                "text": "<p>Your Predictive Thermometer sends readings by Bluetooth. A WiFi Booster, WiFi Display or Giant Grill Gauge receives those readings and sends them on to your phone.</p>",
                                "width": "fit-content",
                                "max_width": "none",
                                "alignment": "left",
                                "type_preset": "custom",
                                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                                "font_size": "1rem",
                                "line_height": "normal",
                                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                                "case": "none",
                                "wrap": "pretty",
                                "text_color": "",
                                "background": false,
                                "background_color": "#00000026",
                                "corner_radius": 0,
                                "padding-block-start": 0,
                                "padding-block-end": 0,
                                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                                "padding-inline-end": 0
                              },
                              "blocks": {}
                            },
                            "image_KVWPBJ": {
                              "type": "image",
                              "name": "t:names.image",
                              "settings": {
                                "image": "shopify://shop_images/kit-relay-preview-v4.webp",
                                "link": "",
                                "image_ratio": "adapt",
                                "width": "custom",
                                "custom_width": 80,
                                "width_mobile": "fill",
                                "custom_width_mobile": 100,
                                "height": "fit",
                                "border": "none",
                                "border_width": 1,
                                "border_opacity": 100,
                                "border_color": "",
                                "border_radius": 20,
                                "padding-block-start": 20,
                                "padding-block-end": 20,
                                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                                "padding-inline-end": 0
                              },
                              "blocks": {}
                            },
                            "text_bK9kqD": {
                              "type": "text",
                              "settings": {
                                "text": "<p><strong>Nearby: Long Range Bluetooth</strong></p><p>Your phone can receive readings directly from the thermometer or through a nearby Combustion accessory. The accessory relays the signal so you can move farther from the thermometer. No WiFi is needed.</p><p><strong>Beyond Bluetooth range: WiFi</strong></p><p>Connect your accessory to WiFi with internet access and sign in to the Combustion app. You can check food temperatures and time until ready wherever your phone has internet access. Changing a target temperature in the app still requires a local Bluetooth connection.</p><p><strong>What affects Bluetooth range?</strong></p><p>Walls, metal and foil reduce range. Keep your accessory where it receives a good signal from the thermometer; WiFi cannot replace that first Bluetooth connection. The second-generation thermometer transmits at +8 dBm, with an unobstructed Bluetooth range rated at 330 feet (100 meters).</p>",
                                "width": "fit-content",
                                "max_width": "none",
                                "alignment": "left",
                                "type_preset": "custom",
                                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                                "font_size": "1rem",
                                "line_height": "normal",
                                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                                "case": "none",
                                "wrap": "pretty",
                                "text_color": "",
                                "background": false,
                                "background_color": "#00000026",
                                "corner_radius": 0,
                                "padding-block-start": 0,
                                "padding-block-end": 0,
                                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                                "padding-inline-end": 0
                              },
                              "blocks": {}
                            }
                          },
                          "block_order": [
                            "text_YEyRtq",
                            "image_KVWPBJ",
                            "text_bK9kqD"
                          ]
                        },
                        "accordion_row_KVGEJw": {
                          "type": "_accordion-row",
                          "settings": {
                            "heading": "Can I add more thermometers or displays later?",
                            "open_by_default": false,
                            "icon": "none",
                            "width": 20
                          },
                          "blocks": {
                            "text_AYdf9m": {
                              "type": "text",
                              "settings": {
                                "text": "<p>Yes. Each WiFi accessory supports up to four Predictive Thermometers. Add another thermometer with its standard charger to cook more foods at once. You don’t need a Booster for every thermometer.</p><p>You can also add another display. Leave a Giant Grill Gauge on your smoker and add a WiFi Display in the kitchen to see the same thermometer’s readings in both places.</p><p>Linked Combustion tools form MeatNet, relaying readings between them. Adding a tool where it receives a good Bluetooth signal provides another path for the readings. Both WiFi accessories can connect to the internet; you don’t need to choose just one.</p>",
                                "width": "fit-content",
                                "max_width": "none",
                                "alignment": "left",
                                "type_preset": "custom",
                                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                                "font_size": "1rem",
                                "line_height": "normal",
                                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                                "case": "none",
                                "wrap": "pretty",
                                "text_color": "",
                                "background": false,
                                "background_color": "#00000026",
                                "corner_radius": 0,
                                "padding-block-start": 0,
                                "padding-block-end": 0,
                                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                                "padding-inline-end": 0
                              },
                              "blocks": {}
                            }
                          },
                          "block_order": [
                            "text_AYdf9m"
                          ]
                        },
                        "accordion_row_ytEQeE": {
                          "type": "_accordion-row",
                          "settings": {
                            "heading": "Already own a Predictive Thermometer?",
                            "open_by_default": false,
                            "icon": "none",
                            "width": 20
                          },
                          "blocks": {
                            "text_MAW4F8": {
                              "type": "text",
                              "settings": {
                                "text": "<p>Add a WiFi Booster, WiFi Display or Giant Grill Gauge on its own. All three work with first- and second-generation Predictive Thermometers, so you can add WiFi without replacing your thermometer.</p>",
                                "width": "fit-content",
                                "max_width": "none",
                                "alignment": "left",
                                "type_preset": "custom",
                                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                                "font_size": "1rem",
                                "line_height": "normal",
                                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                                "case": "none",
